cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use these reproducibility materials, cite this repository. A Zenodo DOI will be added after the production release is archived."
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/shaikhamalkawi-ux/HbA1c-Age-Aware-Reliability-NHANES"
title: "Age-aware HbA1c reliability across NHANES cycles: reproducibility materials"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Malkawi"
    given-names: "Ghassan"
abstract: "Public-safe reproducibility materials for age-aware HbA1c reliability evaluation across NHANES cycles, including source-reconstruction certificates, aggregate repeated out-of-fold and conformal metrics, temporal-transport verification, recovered secondary CQR output checks, and historical ANFIS structural verification. Participant-level NHANES data are not redistributed."
keywords:
  - HbA1c
  - NHANES
  - reproducibility
  - conformal prediction
  - temporal transport
